+/* ---- Phoebus 6.18 cfg80211_ops signature shims ---------------------------
+ * 6.x added radio_idx / link_id parameters (multi-radio, MLO) and changed
+ * change_beacon to take struct cfg80211_ap_update. This driver's handlers carry
+ * the older prototypes, so adapt them here rather than editing each definition.
